CHAPTER.VERS:
And strangers will stand and shepherd your

          {+}
         flocks, and foreigners will be your

          {+}
         plowmen and your

          {+}
         vine-dressers.

But you

          {+}
         will be named the priests of Yahweh; men will call you

          {+}
         the ministers of our God: you

          {+}
         will eat the wealth of the nations, and in their glory you

          {+}
